WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.270
A garden.

2
00:00:01.320 --> 00:00:07.230
Someone hides, listening, as friends
nearby talk loudly, on purpose.

3
00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:10.460
By the end, the listener is in love.

4
00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:12.730
Night, the same garden.

5
00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:14.950
Three men watch a lit window.

6
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.320
A figure leans out, and
a wedding ring cracks.

7
00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:21.240
Same trick: let someone overhear.

8
00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:24.780
So why does one make
love, and one nearly kill?

9
00:00:24.830 --> 00:00:27.700
In this mission, you'll
crack the title's pun:

10
00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:30.540
"There’s not a note of mine
that’s worth the noting."

11
00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:34.080
You'll find a play crammed
with hiding and overhearing.

12
00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:36.600
And you'll watch the garden trick unfold,

13
00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:38.040
line by line.

14
00:00:38.090 --> 00:00:43.240
Your mission: explain why one trick
makes love and the other nearly kills.
